 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Imprisonment is a Virtue ~ I'm the Trash of Society, but will you be Grateful ~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Choueki Ichizen ~Shakai no Gomi desu kedo Kansha shite kuremasu ka~"
   },
   {
    "ja": "懲役一善〜社会のゴミですけど感謝してくれますか〜"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Choueki Ichizen - Shakai no Gomi desu kedo Kansha shite kuremasu ka -"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "15 felons who were imprisoned for serious crimes at Kanto's 8th Penitentiary have been chosen as test subjects for a certain experiment. Those who succeed with the experiment will be rewarded with a \"full pardon\" and Kusunoki, a former police detective, agreed to join the experiment for the reward so he can prove that he was falsely accused of the murder that he was imprisoned for. However...",
   "es": "Quince criminales que han sido encarcelados por delitos graves en la octava penitenciaría de Kanto han sido elegidos como sujetos de prueba para cierto experimento. Aquellos que superen el experimento serán recompensados con un «indulto completo». Kusunoki, un antiguo detective de policía, ha aceptado unirse al experimento para demostrar que fue encarcelado por una falsa acusación de asesinato."
  },
